OL,3,CMoscow restaurant explosion kills
OL,4,Cthree and wounds 15
OL,6,FAn explosion at a restaurant in
OL,7,Fcentral Moscow killed at least three
OL,8,Fpeople, Russian state media said,
OL,9,Fciting local officials.
OL,11,FAt least 15 people were injured in the
OL,12,Fexplosion and investigators, forensic
OL,13,Fexperts and emergency services were
OL,14,Fworking at the scene, Russian state
OL,15,Fnews agency RIA Novosti reported.
