OL,3,CMoscow restaurant explosion kills
OL,4,Cthree and wounds 15
OL,6,FThe exact number of dead and injured,
OL,7,Fas well as the circumstances of the
OL,8,Fincident on Moscow's Kudrinskaya
OL,9,FSquare, are being established, the
OL,10,FMoscow Investigative Committee told
OL,11,Fthe news agency.
OL,13,FThis is a developing news story, more
OL,14,Fas we get it...
